abstract: >-
  A monorepo with two complementary projects: causal-benchmark-zoo (Python
  framework for loading and evaluating causal benchmarks) and
  causal_benchmark_synthetic (43 reproducible benchmark scenarios with
  documented ground truth for structure discovery and effect estimation).
